prompt:
Read the passage. List the statements where it says that one concept REQUIRES, ASSUMES, NEEDS or DEPENDS ON another concept as a precondition (the dependent concept only works or makes sense given the prerequisite). Use only this passage, no outside knowledge.
Give at most 4 statements, each as: dependent (the concept that needs something), prerequisite (what it needs), and an exact quote copied word for word from the passage that states it. Use short entity names as they appear in the passage. A statement that only says two concepts are related, similar or used together does NOT count. If there is none, return an empty list.
Return ONLY JSON: {"items":[{"dependent":str,"prerequisite":str,"quote":str}]}
